        <mxCell id="c73" value="&lt;i&gt;Report view, page Ex 15.5: the chart that starts in January 2024, from the model answer&#x27;s two forecast charts (its twin, from February, is not drawn, nor is the page&#x27;s text box). The date axis is continuous, on the column MonthStart; its labels are drawn in the column&#x27;s Short Date format. The line is the monthly revenue of the 33 months the chart keeps; the shaded band marks the three months the forecast covers, with no values.&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5D6D7E;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="484" width="860" height="53" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
